{"id": "UgzJ8Oib08J3Ay2geVZ4AaABAg", "parent": null, "likes": 0, "text": "재미로만 보세요\n돈 못벌고 거지될 확률이 더 높아요", "published": "2026-09-20T12:14:57", "replies": 0, "creator": false}
{"id": "Ugy2JMfvLYUlO7UNo014AaABAg", "parent": null, "likes": 0, "text": "수익 인증좀.....", "published": "2026-09-20T11:06:41", "replies": 0, "creator": false}
{"id": "UgwdgqedGLqvzSGZkUR4AaABAg", "parent": null, "likes": 0, "text": "2번일수도 3번일수도...5번일수도...각각 다르다 상황에 따라", "published": "2026-09-20T10:22:18", "replies": 0, "creator": false}
{"id": "Ugw9RecBogCdvUJVagd4AaABAg", "parent": null, "likes": 0, "text": "이거보면 개미들이 안털리것네 ㅎ", "published": "2026-09-20T05:40:49", "replies": 0, "creator": false}
