{"id": "UgxNKfEjyNz01k1pLQd4AaABAg.Aay7-8-cXTOAazQ11N1Jce", "parent": "UgxNKfEjyNz01k1pLQd4AaABAg", "likes": 0, "text": "통침신호", "published": "2026-09-20T15:29:01", "replies": 0, "creator": false}
{"id": "Ugw72D9_FIRY7_JN5vJ4AaABAg", "parent": null, "likes": 0, "text": "세번 찍고 나락 가는 것도 많음", "published": "2026-09-20T03:15:28", "replies": 0, "creator": false}
{"id": "Ugx-5al_bvxDJSYXNtV4AaABAg", "parent": null, "likes": 5, "text": "ㅋㅋㅋㅋ 진짜 디나가다가 웃고 갑니다. 네네 열심히 해보세요.", "published": "2026-09-20T00:33:11", "replies": 1, "creator": false}
